              "status": "completed",
              "text": "Created `greet.js` with a `greet(name)` export that returns `\"Hello, <name>!\"`:\n\n```javascript\nfunction greet(name) {\n  return `Hello, ${name}!`;\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { greet };\n```\n\nVerified: `greet('World')` returns `Hello, World!`."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Make name default to \"world\" when greet() is called without arguments.",
              "status": "completed",
              "text": "`greet()` now defaults `name` to `\"world\"`:\n\n```javascript\nfunction greet(name = \"world\") {\n  return `Hello, ${name}!`;\n}\n```\n\n- `greet()` → `\"Hello, world!\"`\n- `greet('Alice')` → `\"Hello, Alice!\"`"
            }
          ],
